# Gba Emulator
===
 A Game Boy Advance emulator written in C. Includes Pokémon Companion, a live panel for Pokémon Emerald, FireRed and LeafGreen with a damage calculator, party and route info, a Nuzlocke tracker and a run timeline, plus Hardware X-Ray Mode.
